@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About ApnaRent";
}

<div class="container py-5" style="max-width:800px;">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">About ApnaRent</h2>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Karachi's peer-to-peer rental marketplace.</p>

    <p>
        ApnaRent connects people who own items they don't use every day with people who need
        those items temporarily. Instead of buying something for one-time use, rent it from
        someone nearby — and if you have items sitting idle, list them and earn from them.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">How it works</h5>
    <p>
        Browse available items by category or search, message the owner if you have questions,
        and book directly through the platform. Every booking is protected — owners approve
        requests, and both sides can track the rental status from start to finish.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Why ApnaRent</h5>
    <p>
        We verify every user through OTP-based email verification, protect bookings from
        double-scheduling with date-conflict checks, and review new listings before they go live —
        so renting on ApnaRent is safer and simpler than dealing with strangers on classified ads.
    </p>
</div>